      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "We do not intend on changing this default behavior. \n\nHowever, we do intend on making the Performance Options prompt easier to find (once the UI permits it), easier to interact with, and provide methods by which users can be informed of new features in the application without having to peruse patch notes or blog posts.\n\nThis should help with discoverability of major changes like this.",
