  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As is now, the dynamic bone toggle is set to OFF by default. This seems kinda silly to me since new players won't even know what dynamic bones are and won't be able to see it. I also put dynamic bones on my model for animations, and now they'll be broken for people by default. Let people be able to at least see dynamic bones by default and turn them off if they want to, not the other way around.",
